      "name": "根轨迹",
      "nodeType": "THEORY",
      "description": "根轨迹是当系统开环增益从零变化到无穷大时，闭环系统特征根在复平面上移动的轨迹。",
      "positionX": -33.1,
      "positionY": 123.6,
      "positionZ": 4,
      "bloomLevel": "UNDERSTAND",
      "knowledgeDim": "CONCEPTUAL",
